      en: ["A privately-owned zoo located in Barka.", "Home to big cats like lions, tigers, and leopards.", "Large bird collection with parrots, macaws, and birds of prey.", "Popular with families for day trips.", "Features a petting zoo section for children.", "The zoo is compact and easy to walk around.", "Also features reptiles like crocodiles and snakes."]
